---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page title="Services — CloudAlgo"
      description="Salesforce consulting, AppExchange product development, and managed services from CloudAlgo.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="heroBanner-innerPage service-banner">
    <section class="banner-caption d-flex">
      <div class="container d-flex align-content-center flex-wrap">
        <div class="banner-caption_inner">
          <h1>What We Do</h1>
          <p class="paragraph-large breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span class="icon-arrow_forward"></span>
            Services
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Services Content -->
  <section class="sercvice-base-section section-padding--vertical">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="heading-n-description">
        <h2>Our Services</h2>
        <p class="paragraph-large">At CloudAlgo, we specialize in delivering tailored cloud solutions that empower businesses to achieve operational excellence and innovation. With expertise spanning <b>Salesforce, Heroku, MuleSoft, AWS, Snowflake,</b> and <b>Apache Airflow</b>, we provide a full range of services to meet your unique needs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="heading-n-description card-1">
        <h3 class="font32 orange">Salesforce Consulting &amp; Implementation</h3>
        <p class="paragraph-large">Revolutionize your business processes with our Salesforce expertise:
          <ul class="arrow">
            <li><b>CRM Customization:</b> Align Salesforce with your business workflows for maximum efficiency.</li>
            <li><b>Integrations:</b> Seamlessly connect Salesforce with other platforms and tools.</li>
            <li><b>AppExchange Development:</b> Develop and deploy custom applications tailored to your needs.</li>
            <li><b>Optimization &amp; Support:</b> Ensure your Salesforce environment is always performing at its best.</li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="heading-n-description card-1">
        <h3 class="font32 orange">Heroku Application Development</h3>
        <p class="paragraph-large">Harness the power of Heroku to create, deploy, and scale applications effortlessly:
          <ul class="arrow">
            <li><b>Custom Applications:</b> Build modern, scalable cloud apps tailored to your goals.</li>
            <li><b>Salesforce Integration:</b> Connect Heroku apps to Salesforce for seamless workflows.</li>
            <li><b>Continuous Deployment:</b> Implement DevOps strategies for efficient application management.</li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="heading-n-description card-1">
        <h3 class="font32 orange">MuleSoft Integration Services</h3>
        <p class="paragraph-large">Connect your ecosystem with powerful MuleSoft integrations:
          <ul class="arrow">
            <li><b>API-Led Connectivity:</b> Create APIs that bridge your applications, data, and devices.</li>
            <li><b>Enterprise Workflows:</b> Automate complex business processes to save time and reduce errors.</li>
            <li><b>Real-Time Data Flow:</b> Enable seamless, real-time communication across systems.</li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="heading-n-description card-1">
        <h3 class="font32 orange">AWS Cloud Solutions</h3>
        <p class="paragraph-large">Unlock the potential of AWS for your business:
          <ul class="arrow">
            <li><b>Cloud Architecture Design:</b> Build secure and scalable cloud infrastructures.</li>
            <li><b>Data Migration:</b> Move existing systems to AWS with minimal downtime.</li>
            <li><b>Analytics &amp; Insights:</b> Use AWS tools to gain deeper business intelligence from your data.</li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="heading-n-description card-1">
        <h3 class="font32 orange">Support &amp; Managed Services</h3>
        <p class="paragraph-large">Keep your Salesforce org running at peak performance:
          <ul class="arrow">
            <li><b>Ongoing Support:</b> Dedicated team available for issues and enhancements.</li>
            <li><b>Health Reviews:</b> Regular org health checks and security recommendations.</li>
            <li><b>Proactive Monitoring:</b> Stay ahead of issues before they impact your business.</li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Development Process -->
  <section class="process-section grey-bg2 section-padding--vertical">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="heading-n-description text-center">
        <h2>Our Development Process</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="row" style="justify-content:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        {['Discovery', 'Define', 'Design & Architect', 'Develop & Test', 'Deploy', 'Support & Enhancement'].map((step, i) => (
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
            <div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ca-orange);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;flex-shrink:0;">{i+1}</div>
            <span style="font-weight:600;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;">{step}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Page>
